      "content": "i dont want to take walks or do \"activities.\" thats just more effort to stay in a reality that feels like it doesnt even exist. if i'm already just a ghost, why am i fighting so hard to stay tethered to something so heavy and exhausting? it feels like im just dragging this body around for no reason. part of me thinks maybe being a ghost is just how things are supposed to be. maybe there's more peace in just... letting go of the tether entirely.",
